        <section class="inspector-section budget-inspector"><div class="section-title"><h3>Schema 注入预算</h3><span>18 / 64</span></div><div class="budget-track"><i :style="{ width: `${budgetPercent}%` }"></i></div><p>约 3.8k tokens / 次 · 按 Agent 类型裁剪工具集，减少无关定义。</p></section>
      </aside>
    </div>

